senses.gloss:
सम्-आ-√ नी P. Ā. -नयति, ˚ते, to lead or conduct together, join, unite, collect, assemble, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to lead anyone to another, unite one person (acc.) with another (instr. with or without सह), ib.;
to lead towards, bring near, ib.;
to bring home, ib.;
to pour together, mingle (liquids), ŚBr.; KātyŚr.;
to bring or offer (an oblation), MBh. :
Caus. -नाययति (ind.p. -नाय्य), to cause to be brought together or near, convoke, assemble, MBh.; Hariv.; R.

सम्-√ मन् Ā. मन्यते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to think together, agree, assent to, approve (see सम्-मत below);
to think, fancy, MBh.;
to regard or consider as (acc. or two acc.), ib. &c.;
to mean, contemplate, intend, resolve, R.;
to think highly of, esteem, value, honour, MBh.; R. :
Caus. -मानयति, to honour, reverence, respect, Yājñ.; MBh. &c.;
to regard, consider, Bhaṭṭ.;
to assure any one (gen.) of (acc.), MārkP. :
Desid. of Caus. See सम्-मिमानयिषु below.

सम्-अनु-√ ज्ञा P. Ā. -जानाति, -जनीते, to fully permit or allow or consent to, wholly acquiesce in or approve of (acc.), MBh.; Hariv.;
to authorize, empower, ib.;
to indulge, pardon, forgive, excuse (gen. of pers.), R.;
to grant leave of absence, allow to go away, dismiss, MBh.;
to favour, ib. :
Caus. -ज्ञापयति, to beg or request any favour from (abl.), MBh.;
to ask leave, beg permission from (abl.), ib.; R.;
to take leave of, bid adieu (acc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to greet, salute, MBh.

सम्-अनु-√ पश् P. Ā. -पश्यति, ˚ते (only pres. base), to look well after, look at or on MBh.; BhP.;
to perceive, observe, MBh.; SaddhP.;
to regard as, consider, MBh.

सम्-अनु-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते, to follow after, obey, conform to (acc.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to ensue, be the result or consequence, BhP. :
Caus. -वर्तयति, to cause to take place or happen, R.

सम्-√ मन्त्र् P. -मन्त्रयति (ind.p. -मन्त्र्य, or -मन्त्रयित्वा), to consult together, take council with (instr. with or without सह or समम्), MBh.; R. &c.;
to hold a council, deliberate, advise, express an opinion, R.;
to salute, greet, address, MBh.
